  nonce: '16e1'  # 16e1
  message: "Filter 1 implementation done on jgstern-agent/feat/wi-zafab-prospector-polyglot-filter. New harness-level polyglot check in scripts/dead-code-prospector-run.py: walks the repo (skipping vendor/, node_modules/, etc.), counts files by language extension across 18 supported languages, requires 2+ languages with >=10 files each to count as polyglot. Monoglot repos are skipped with clear stderr message and surfaced in the aggregate JSON as repos_skipped_monoglot. New --include-monoglot CLI flag to override. 13 new tests cover language counting, threshold logic, and end-to-end run_prospecting with monkey-patched _run_hypergumbo. Filter 2 was already shipped previously. Filter 3 still depends on WI-zimum exported-symbols detection."  # 16e1
